		{"id":"8f79cf8034a70837","type":"text","text":"`() : Grouping Operator -> Multiple condition ko group karane ke liye`\n```\n(site: github.com OR site: google.com) python\ninurl : (html | php)\niphone (14|15) discount\n```\n\n`* : wildword -> Missing word ko represent karata hai `\n```\nEx -> python * tutorial\n\t  python socket tutorial\n\t  python networking tutorial\n\t  python programming tutorial\n```\n\n`\" \" -> Exact Match : mtlb word to word search`\n```\n\"Python tutorial 2025\"\n\"Python tutorial 2026\"\n\"Hacking Pdf 2026\"\n```\n\n`m..n (Number Range)`\n```\nBest Laptop 40000..70000 INR\nWorld cup winner 1990..2010\n```\n\n`- (Excluds)`\n```\nJo Word result mai nahi chahiye aage minus laga do\nrecepie -nonveg\njobs -sales\n```\n\n`| ya OR (Logical OR)`\n```\nKisi multiple qry mai kisi 1 ko dudna hai \n\"google\" | \"Yahoo\"\nandorid OR iso tutorial\n```\n\n`index of : website k server ki direct file dictionary kholata h`\n```\nindex of : MP4 VIDEO\nindex of : python books\n```\n\n`@ : social media search`\n```\n@instagram virat kohali\n@github akprajapti\n```\n\n`related : similar website dikhata h`\n```\nrelated : wikipedia.org\nrelated : stackoverflow\n```\n`source : google news m use hota h`\n```\nsite : bbc.com\nsource : bbc.com\n```","x":202,"y":-771,"width":640,"height":1543},
		{"id":"c8ed74d89fde967a","type":"text","text":"`intitle      : Words heading mai hone chahiye`\n```\nEx -> crypto news => crypto title m hoga or new page m kahi bhi\n```\n`allintitile : Sare words heading mai hone chahiye `\n```\nEx -> crypto news => yaha dono words heading m hi hone chahiye\n```\n`inurl : website ki link m url dudenga`\n```\ninurl : contect us\nallinurl : search google com\n```\n`intext : Heading ya url ko chhod kar , website ke page par words dundtaa hai`\n`allintext: same as it is ye bhi`\n```\nintext : breaking news\nallintext: math science university\n```\n\n`Date : After & Before`\n```\nchatgpt update after:2024\niphone bunch before : 2019-04-03\n```\n\n`AROUND(n) : 2 word 1 dusare ke n numbers ke aas pas ho jyada dur na ho`\n```\nAROUND(10) GOD\n```\n\n`site : website ke andar se result nikal kar deta h`\n```\nsite : youtube.com tech review\nsite : gov.in scholarship\n```\n\n`filetype : , ext : -> dono bilkul same hai file format ke liye`\n```\nai report filetype:pdf\nai report ext:pdf\n```\n`define : kisi bhi word ka direct dictionary word dikhata h`\n```\ndefine : funny\ndefine : blockchain\n```\n`stock : kisi bhi company ke share price or graph live dikhata h`\n```\nstock : apple\nstock : tata motors\n```","x":942,"y":-681,"width":700,"height":1363},
